===Pronunciation===
* {{a|PT}} {{IPA|pt|/ɨʃ.ˈki.nɐ/}}
* {{a|Brazil}} {{IPA|pt|/es.ˈki.na/|/is.ˈki.nɐ/}}
* {{hyph|pt|es|qui|na}}

===Noun===
{{pt-noun|f}}

# {{l|en|angle}} {{gloss|corner where two walls intersect}}
#: {{syn|pt|ângulo|canto}}
# {{l|en|corner}} {{gloss|of a street}}
#: {{uxi|pt|A casa faz '''esquina''' com a rua República|The house is on the '''corner''' of rua República.}}
#: {{uxi|pt|Natal está ao virar da '''esquina'''.|Christmas is around the '''corner'''.}}

